# PvP Lobby + Realtime Clients (Web)

- Treat REST as the source of truth. Websocket frames are versioned hints only; always rehydrate.
- Authenticate sockets with Laravel tickets only. Never put Sanctum cookies/tokens in WS URLs beyond the one-time ticket query.
- Subscribe to rooms only after redeeming a Laravel subscription grant. Do not send client-chosen `player_id` as authority.
- Deduplicate by `event_id` and ignore stale `version` payloads.
- Also handle `pvp.battle.changed` as a hint (room/battle IDs + version/sequence only).
- Combat UI belongs to Phase 5B.3 REST-driven arena screens — never invent damage/XP locally.
